agent-readiness/index.html:411:          <span class="lang-ja">既存HPに追加できるAI検索対応アドオン</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:412:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">AI Search Readiness Add-on for Existing Sites</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:415:          <span class="lang-ja">作り直し不要。今あるホームページに、検索・AI・問い合わせ導線の補強を追加します。会社情報、サービス内容、FAQ、構造化データを整備し、Google検索・マップ・生成AI検索に伝わりやすい営業基盤へ整えます。</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:416:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">No full rebuild required. We add crucial search, AI, and inquiry structures to your existing website, ensuring your business is discoverable and readable by Google Search, Maps, and AI agents.</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:418:        <div class="hero-cta">
agent-readiness/index.html:420:            <span class="lang-ja">無料でAI検索・HP診断を依頼する</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:421:            <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Request Free AI Diagnostics</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:424:            <span class="lang-ja">プランを見る</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:425:            <span class="lang-en" lang="en">View Plans</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:434:        <h2><span class="lang-ja">こんな課題はありませんか？</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Common Challenges</span></h2>
agent-readiness/index.html:436:          <span class="lang-ja">デザインを綺麗にしても、情報設計や検索・AI向けの構造が弱ければ見込み客には届きません。</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:437:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Beautiful design alone cannot generate leads if the underlying information architecture is weak.</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:441:          <li><span class="lang-ja">会社名でしか検索されない（サービス名で見つからない）。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Discoverable only by brand name, not service keywords.</span></li>
agent-readiness/index.html:442:          <li><span class="lang-ja">Googleマップの情報が弱く、地域検索で負けている。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Weak Google Business Profile presence losing local search.</span></li>
agent-readiness/index.html:443:          <li><span class="lang-ja">ホームページから問い合わせが来ない。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Website generates zero or very few inquiries.</span></li>
agent-readiness/index.html:444:          <li><span class="lang-ja">AIに聞いても、自社が候補に出てこない。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Generative AI doesn't include your company in its suggestions.</span></li>
agent-readiness/index.html:445:          <li><span class="lang-ja">何を頼める会社か、訪問者にパッと伝わっていない。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Unclear value proposition for immediate visitors.</span></li>
agent-readiness/index.html:452:            <span class="lang-ja">左：情報構造が整理され、AIがスムーズにデータを連携できるHP<br>右：構造化されておらず、AIが情報を探せず迷子になるHP</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:453:            <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Left: Structured architecture where AI seamlessly connects data.<br>Right: Unstructured pages where AI struggles to extract information.</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:462:        <h2><span class="lang-ja">AIが会社情報を取得する4つの経路</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">4 Pathways of AI Information Retrieval</span></h2>
agent-readiness/index.html:464:          <span class="lang-ja">「AI検索対応」は流行語でも魔法でもありません。AIがウェブから情報を拾い上げる実際の経路（パス）は複数存在します。本アドオンでは、それぞれの経路における技術的な障害を取り除きます。</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:465:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">"AI Search Readiness" is not magic. AI systems gather information through multiple distinct technical pathways. Our add-on clears technical roadblocks across all of them.</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:472:              <span class="lang-ja" style="line-height: 1.6;">見込み客の質問<br><strong style="color:var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.1rem;">「高い技術力でレガシーシステムの刷新を任せられる会社は？」</strong></span>
agent-readiness/index.html:473:              <span class="lang-en" lang="en" style="line-height: 1.6;">Prospect's Query<br><strong style="color:var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.1rem;">"Highly technical companies for legacy system modernization?"</strong></span>
agent-readiness/index.html:481:              <span class="lang-ja">生成AI・検索AIが情報を探す</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:482:              <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Generative AI / Search AI looks for information</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:492:                <div class="flow-tree-title"><span class="lang-ja">1. 検索エンジンのインデックス</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">1. Search Engine Index</span></div>
agent-readiness/index.html:493:                <div class="flow-tree-desc"><span class="lang-ja">Google / Bing が巡回して整理したWeb情報</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Web data crawled and organized by Google / Bing</span></div>
agent-readiness/index.html:499:                <div class="flow-tree-title"><span class="lang-ja">2. リアルタイムWeb検索</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">2. Real-time Web Search</span></div>
agent-readiness/index.html:500:                <div class="flow-tree-desc"><span class="lang-ja">ChatGPT Search / Claude Web Search など</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">ChatGPT Search / Claude Web Search, etc.</span></div>
agent-readiness/index.html:506:                <div class="flow-tree-title"><span class="lang-ja">3. 学習用・検索用クローラー</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">3. Training & Search Crawlers</span></div>
agent-readiness/index.html:507:                <div class="flow-tree-desc"><span class="lang-ja">OAI-SearchBot / GPTBot / ClaudeBot / Google-Extended など</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">OAI-SearchBot / GPTBot / ClaudeBot / Google-Extended, etc.</span></div>
agent-readiness/index.html:513:                <div class="flow-tree-title"><span class="lang-ja">4. AIエージェントの直接閲覧</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">4. Agent Direct Parsing</span></div>
agent-readiness/index.html:514:                <div class="flow-tree-desc"><span class="lang-ja">HTML / ボタン / フォーム / アクセシビリティツリー</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Raw HTML / Buttons / Forms / Accessibility Trees</span></div>
agent-readiness/index.html:523:              <span class="lang-ja" style="line-height: 1.6;"><strong style="color:var(--text-primary);">会社HPに必要な補強</strong><br><span style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.95rem;">会社情報・サービス・地域・FAQ・問い合わせ導線・構造化データ</span></span>
agent-readiness/index.html:524:              <span class="lang-en" lang="en" style="line-height: 1.6;"><strong style="color:var(--text-primary);">Required HP Reinforcements</strong><br><span style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.95rem;">Company Info・Services・Region・FAQ・Contact Flows・Structured Data</span></span>
agent-readiness/index.html:532:              <span class="lang-ja" style="line-height: 1.6;"><strong style="color:var(--text-primary);">「三嶋電算です！」</strong><br><span style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.95rem;">東京都千代田区神田須田町2丁目19-23 Daiwa秋葉原ビル 2F (登記本店)<br>静岡県三島市 (創設)</span></span>
agent-readiness/index.html:533:              <span class="lang-en" lang="en" style="line-height: 1.6;"><strong style="color:var(--text-primary);">"It's Mishima Computing!"</strong><br><span style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.95rem;">Daiwa Akihabara Bldg. 2F, 2-19-23 Kanda Sudacho, Chiyoda-ku, Tokyo (HQ)<br>Founded in Mishima, Shizuoka</span></span>
agent-readiness/index.html:541:            <h3 class="card-title"><span class="lang-ja">検索エンジンのデータベース</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Search Engine Index</span></h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:543:              <p class="lang-ja">Googleなどが巡回して構築する巨大なデータベース。多くのAI検索もこれを土台にするため、まずは従来のクローラビリティ（sitemapやセマンティックタグ）を完璧にすることが大前提です。</p>
agent-readiness/index.html:544:              <p class="lang-en" lang="en" style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">The massive databases built by crawlers like Googlebot. Since most AI search features use this as their foundation, flawless core crawlability (sitemaps, semantic HTML) remains essential.</p>
agent-readiness/index.html:550:            <h3 class="card-title"><span class="lang-ja">生成AI検索とRAG</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Generative AI & RAG</span></h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:552:              <p class="lang-ja">AIがユーザーの質問を複数のキーワードに分解して（Query Fan-out）情報をかき集める経路。社名だけでなく、課題名や地域名で発見されるようコンテンツ構造を整えます。</p>
agent-readiness/index.html:553:              <p class="lang-en" lang="en" style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">The process where AI breaks down user questions into multiple sub-queries to gather information. Content must be structured around challenges and locations, not just the company name.</p>
agent-readiness/index.html:559:            <h3 class="card-title"><span class="lang-ja">その場でのリアルタイム検索</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Real-time Web Search</span></h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:561:              <p class="lang-ja">ChatGPT Searchなどが、会話の中でその場でWebを検索する経路。引用元として選ばれやすくするため、FAQの充実や回答しやすい明確なテキスト配置を行います。</p>
agent-readiness/index.html:562:              <p class="lang-en" lang="en" style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">Instances where tools like ChatGPT perform live web searches during a conversation. Clear FAQs and logically placed text increase the chances of being cited.</p>
agent-readiness/index.html:568:            <h3 class="card-title"><span class="lang-ja">AIエージェントの直接閲覧</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Agent Direct Parsing</span></h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:570:              <p class="lang-ja">人間の代わりに自律して動くAIが、直接HPのHTMLを読み取る経路。見た目だけでなく、ボタンやフォームの「意味」がAIに伝わるアクセシビリティ構造が必須になります。</p>
agent-readiness/index.html:571:              <p class="lang-en" lang="en" style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">Autonomous AI agents reading your raw HTML on behalf of users. Beyond visual design, interactive elements like buttons and forms must have clear semantic meaning.</p>
agent-readiness/index.html:578:            <span class="lang-ja">※学習用クローラーへの配慮 (robots.txtの設計)</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:579:            <span class="lang-en" lang="en">*Consideration for Training Crawlers (robots.txt)</span>
