agent-readiness/index.html:584:          <p class="lang-en" lang="en" style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-secondary);">
agent-readiness/index.html:594:        <h2><span class="lang-ja">アドオンで追加・改善するもの</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">What We Add & Improve</span></h2>
agent-readiness/index.html:599:            <h3 class="card-title"><span class="lang-ja">情報構造の最適化</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Information Architecture</span></h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:601:              <p class="lang-ja">正確な登記住所や法人格の明記によるエンティティ（実体）の確定、サービスページの改善、問い合わせ前の不安を解消するFAQの追加など、AIが迷わない情報整理を行います。</p>
agent-readiness/index.html:602:              <p class="lang-en" lang="en" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">We eliminate AI confusion by consolidating your entity with exact registered addresses, improving service pages, and adding targeted FAQs.</p>
agent-readiness/index.html:607:            <h3 class="card-title"><span class="lang-ja">機械可読シグナルの追加</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Machine Readable Signals</span></h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:609:              <p class="lang-ja">「構造化データを置けば推薦される」という神話ではなく、AIの推論負荷（RAGの検索手間）を減らし、企業エンティティを確定させるためのJSON-LDを注入します。</p>
agent-readiness/index.html:610:              <p class="lang-en" lang="en" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">Instead of treating structured data as magic SEO dust, we inject precise JSON-LD to consolidate your Knowledge Graph entity and reduce inference overhead for AI/RAG systems.</p>
agent-readiness/index.html:615:            <h3 class="card-title"><span class="lang-ja">問い合わせ・マップ導線</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Contact & Map Routing</span></h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:617:              <p class="lang-ja">迷わずアクションできる問い合わせ導線の改善と、Googleビジネスプロフィールの情報を整理・連携します。</p>
agent-readiness/index.html:618:              <p class="lang-en" lang="en" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">We improve inquiry routing for frictionless actions and synchronize information with your Google Business Profile.</p>
agent-readiness/index.html:623:            <h3 class="card-title"><span class="lang-ja">AIクローラー向け平文案内</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">LLM-Readable Endpoints</span></h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:625:              <p class="lang-ja">検索AIや自律型エージェントがサイト全体を俯瞰できるよう、ノイズのない平文の案内図 (<code>llms.txt</code>) を標準配置します。</p>
agent-readiness/index.html:626:              <p class="lang-en" lang="en" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">We deploy standard machine-readable endpoints like <code>llms.txt</code> so AI crawlers can map your core pages and entity info without HTML noise.</p>
