              <span class="lang-en" lang="en" style="line-height: 1.6;"><strong style="color:var(--text-primary);">"It's Mishima Computing!"</strong><br><span style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.95rem;">Daiwa Akihabara Bldg. 2F, 2-19-23 Kanda Sudacho, Chiyoda-ku, Tokyo (HQ)<br>Founded in Mishima, Shizuoka</span></span>
