             <div class="card-body">
               <p class="lang-ja">設計書をもとにテスト用コード（Playwright）を自動構築・実行し、仕様変更に即追従するテストエンジンの実装結果。</p>
               <p class="lang-en" lang="en">Presenting empirical data on autonomous testing workflows that drastically lower QA overhead in large business platforms.</p>
+              <details class="static-report-detail">
+                <summary>
+                  <span class="lang-ja">全文を読む</span>
