+# stage-b-section-rhythm-table
+
+Contract: IC-20260612-stageA-uiux-spec-001
+
+## Index Rhythm
+
+| Order | Section | Type | Notes |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| 1 | `#hero-section .hero-first-viewport` | register | Personhood, one proof artifact, one action. |
+| 2 | `#hero-section .hero-claim` | promise | Frozen hero claim and secondary report action; metrics below first viewport. |
+| 3 | `#about` | register | Company copy plus trust-register deep links. |
+| 4 | `#services` | promise | Service cards with proof-neighbor links. |
+| 5 | `#reports` | proof | Report cards and static report detail. |
+| 6 | `#github` | proof | Organization provenance CTA. |
+| 7 | `#contact` | action | Contact/demo CTA paired with serverless proof copy. |
+
+No more than 2 consecutive sections share the same type. First 5 major sections include register, promise, and proof families.
+
+## Other Views
+
+| View | Section sequence | Run-length result |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `/agent-readiness/` | action, disclosure, proof, register, proof, register, action, disclosure, action | Pass. |
+| `/contact/` | action + proof in one two-column main region | Pass. |
+| `/kessan/` | disclosure, proof/register | Pass. |
+| `/privacy/` | disclosure, action | Pass. |
+| `/reports/waterfall-agents/` | long-form, proof/action | Pass. |
