./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:318:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Pending Issue Management, Consensus Gate</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:321:                <span class="lang-ja">AIが判断に迷った際、人間に仕様確認を求めるプロセス</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:322:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Process where AI requests human clarification on specifications</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:328:                <span class="lang-ja">工程アウトプット・作業成果物</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:329:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Phase Output, Work Product</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:332:                <span class="lang-ja">まだ承認されていない、AIによるコードの修正案</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:333:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Unapproved code modification proposed by AI</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:339:                <span class="lang-ja">構成識別子・ベースライン</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:340:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Configuration Identifier, Baseline</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:343:                <span class="lang-ja">修正案が作られた時点での正確なコードの状態（ハッシュ値）</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:344:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">The exact code state (hash) at the time the patch was generated</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:350:                <span class="lang-ja">適用先構成の再確認</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:351:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Target Configuration Re-verification</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:354:                <span class="lang-ja">パッチを適用する直前に、他の変更と競合していないかの確認</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:355:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Verifying no conflicts exist before applying the patch</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:361:                <span class="lang-ja">検証・レビュー・テスト記録</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:362:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Verification, Review, Test Records</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:365:                <span class="lang-ja">AIの推論ではなく、テストやリンターによる機械的・決定論的な品質チェック</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:366:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Mechanical, deterministic quality checks by tests/linters</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:372:                <span class="lang-ja">監査証拠・監査調書相当</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:373:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Audit Evidence, Audit Working Papers</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:376:                <span class="lang-ja">AIの思考過程やツールの実行結果をまとめた証跡</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:377:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Consolidated evidence of AI reasoning and tool execution results</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:383:                <span class="lang-ja">独立監査者・客観的評価者</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:384:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Independent Auditor, Objective Evaluator</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:387:                <span class="lang-ja">実装者（Claude）とは別に、成果物を第三者視点でチェックするエージェント</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:388:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">An agent reviewing work products from a third-party perspective</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:394:                <span class="lang-ja">発注者・利用部門・最終受入責任者</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:395:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Ordering Party, Final Acceptance Authority</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:398:                <span class="lang-ja">最終的なシステムへのマージやデプロイを承認する権限を持つ人間</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:399:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">The human authorized to approve final merges and deployments</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:405:                <span class="lang-ja">変更管理・是正処置の上限</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:406:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Change Management, Corrective Action Limits</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:409:                <span class="lang-ja">エラー時の自動修正試行回数に上限を設け、無限ループを防ぐ仕組み</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:410:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Mechanism limiting automated fix attempts to prevent infinite loops</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:416:                <span class="lang-ja">生ログ・監査対象外の未加工証跡</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:417:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Raw Logs, Unprocessed Evidence</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:420:                <span class="lang-ja">AIが実行時に出力した生のデータ。機密情報を含むリスクがあるためコミットしない</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:421:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Raw AI execution data. Not committed due to confidentiality risks.</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:427:                <span class="lang-ja">提出可能な要約証跡</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:428:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Submittable Summarized Evidence</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:431:                <span class="lang-ja">生ログから機密情報をマスクし、リポジトリに保存できる形にした記録</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:432:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Records masked of confidential info, safe for repository storage</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:438:                <span class="lang-ja">情報管理・漏洩リスク管理</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:439:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Information Management, Leak Risk Control</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:442:                <span class="lang-ja">機密な生ログが誤ってクラウドに同期されないようにするための安全停止</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:443:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Safety stop preventing accidental cloud synchronization of confidential raw logs</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:451:        <span class="lang-ja">4. 6つの役割と境界</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:452:        <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Roles & Authority Boundaries</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:455:        <p class="lang-ja">作成者（Producer）、評価者（Reviewer）、採用者（Adopter）、リリース権限者（Release Authority）の各ロールを明確に分離し、最終的な受入とシステム稼働の責任は人間が負う体制を構築します。下の図と表は、その役割分担と工程統制ループを示します。</p>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:456:        <p class="lang-en" lang="en">We establish a strict separation between producer, reviewer, adopter, and release authority, ensuring that the ultimate acceptance and operational responsibility rest with a human. The diagram and table below illustrate this division of roles and the control loop.</p>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:529:              <span class="lang-ja">役割 (Role)</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:530:              <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Role</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:533:              <span class="lang-ja">権限と境界</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:534:              <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Authority & Scope</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:545:              <span class="lang-ja">Merge, Push, Deploy, Publishの最終権限を持つ。本番データ・認証情報・法的決定権を管理。</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:546:              <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Controls merge, push, deploy, publish, production data, credentials, and legal/privacy/brand decisions.</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:555:              <span class="lang-ja">タスクのルーティング、パッチの検証と採用、ローカルコミットを実行。<strong>※デプロイは行わない</strong>。</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:556:              <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Routes tasks, adopts accepted patches, verifies work, and creates local commits. <strong>Cannot deploy</strong>.</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:565:              <span class="lang-ja">独立した読み取り専用（read-only）のレビュワー。構造化された監査結果を返す。</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:566:              <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Independent read-only reviewer. Returns structured deterministic findings.</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:575:              <span class="lang-ja">パッチ候補のみを作成する実装者。</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:576:              <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Produces patch-only candidates without adoption authority.</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:585:              <span class="lang-ja">UI/UX/ブラウザのレビュースペシャリスト。既定では読み取り専用で、バックエンドやDB・パッケージ変更を行わない。</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:586:              <span class="lang-en" lang="en">UI/UX/graphic/browser review specialist. Defaults to review-only; does not change backend, auth, or DB logic.</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:595:              <span class="lang-ja">決定論的なエビデンス（テスト実行結果など）を生成する。</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:596:              <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Generates deterministic execution evidence.</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:603:        <span class="lang-ja">責任分界と受入</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:604:        <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Responsibility boundaries and acceptance</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:607:        <span class="lang-ja">本モデルでは、作成者（producer）、評価者（reviewer）、採用者（adopter）、リリース権限者（release authority）という古典的かつ確実な職責の分離に従っています。
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:609:        <span class="lang-en" lang="en">This follows the classical separation between producer, reviewer, adopter, and release authority. The Human Owner is analogous to the business-side owner, ordering party, and acceptance authority (though not identical to any specific legal role). The Candidate Implementer is strictly a patch producer, possessing no acceptance authority. The Supervisor Codex can adopt accepted patches locally but cannot push, deploy, or publish by default. The Codex Auditor must remain read-only and strictly independent from the implementation.</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:613:        <span class="lang-ja">非機能要求としてのAI運用</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:614:        <span class="lang-en" lang="en">AI operations as non-functional requirements</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:617:        <span class="lang-ja">生のプロンプト、標準出力・標準エラー出力（stdout/stderr）、スクリーンショットやブラウザ録画、ローカルパスやクラウド同期パスといったデータは、単なる「実装の副産物（詳細）」ではありません。これらは機密性（confidentiality）、追跡可能性（traceability）、監査可能性（auditability）、および運用管理上の要請といった<strong>非機能要求（運用要求・情報管理要求）</strong>として厳格に扱われます。
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:619:        <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Raw prompts, stdout/stderr, screenshots, browser recordings, local paths, and cloud-sync paths are not merely implementation details. We treat them as critical concerns regarding confidentiality, traceability, auditability, and operational control (non-functional requirements).
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:626:        <span class="lang-ja">5. 中核契約</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:627:        <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Core contracts</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:630:        <p class="lang-ja">安全に動かすために、システムが必ず守る「最低限の約束事」です。</p>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:631:        <p class="lang-en" lang="en">These are the minimum rules the system always follows to operate safely.</p>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:634:        <span class="lang-ja">システムを安全に動作させるための機械的なガバナンスルールです：</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:635:        <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Mechanical governance rules required to operate the system securely:</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:639:          <span class="lang-ja">設計分類（classification）前にコードを書かない</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:640:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">No writes allowed before classification is finalized</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:643:          <span class="lang-ja">汚れたリポジトリ（dirty repo）では動作を停止する</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:644:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Hard stop enforced if the repository is dirty</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:647:          <span class="lang-ja">生成途中の生データ（.agent-runs/）はコミットせず、無害化されたサマリ（sanitized summaries）のみをコミットする</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:648:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Raw artifacts in `.agent-runs/` are ignored; only sanitized summaries are committed</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:655:          <span class="lang-ja">6. 非目標 (Non-goals)</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:656:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">6. Non-goals</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:659:          <span class="lang-ja" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-primary);">誤解を避けるため、この仕組みが「やらないこと」も明記します。</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:660:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-primary);">To avoid misunderstanding, we also state clearly what this system does not do.</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:661:          <span class="lang-ja">当ブートストラップ（ガバナンス層）は、以下の機能を<strong>提供しません</strong>。<br>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:663:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">This bootstrap does <strong>not provide</strong> autonomous deployment, secret handling, production data access, or CI/provider configuration. It does not guarantee that scanners prove the complete absence of secrets. It is strictly a governance layer, not application code or deploy configuration.</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:674:        <span class="lang-ja">オープンソースで公開中</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:675:        <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Available Open Source</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:678:        <span class="lang-ja">本ガバナンス層のコアとなるブートストラップ定義やポリシーは、GitHubにて公開されています（ライセンス選定中）。また、これらを応用したシステム開発・技術検証に関するご相談も承っております。</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:679:        <span class="lang-en" lang="en">The core bootstrap definitions and policies for this governance layer are published on GitHub. We also welcome consultations for applying these models to your mission-critical system validation.</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:685:          <span class="lang-ja">GitHub リポジトリ</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:686:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">GitHub Repository</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:689:          <span class="lang-ja">技術検証のご相談</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:690:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Consult with Us</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:707:          <span class="lang-ja">AIエージェント、分散クラウドインフラ、高信頼性業務システムの設計および技術検証を行うエンジニアリング・ブティック。</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:708:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Engineering boutique specializing in AI agents, distributed clouds, and enterprise validation.</span>
