./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:259:        <h2><span class="lang-ja">攻めのWeb基盤としてのAI対応</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">AI readiness as growth infrastructure</span></h2>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:261:          <span class="lang-ja">AI検索対応は、単なるSEOやOPEX削減ではありません。潜在顧客がAIに「こういう会社を探して」と依頼した時、AIが三嶋電算を正しく候補に入れ、技術領域・実装姿勢・問い合わせ方法を明確に説明できる状態を作ることです。</span>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:262:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">AI-readiness is not merely SEO or operational cost reduction. It prepares the website so that when a potential customer asks an AI system to find a suitable engineering partner, the AI can identify Mishima Computing, summarize its technical scope, and route the user to the right action.</span>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:268:            <h3 class="card-title"><span class="lang-ja">会社エンティティを一意にする</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Define a single company entity</span></h3>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:270:              <p class="lang-ja">社名、英語名、URL、ロゴ、GitHub、所在地、対応領域を構造化データで明示し、検索AIが「誰のサイトか」を誤読しにくくします。</p>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:271:              <p class="lang-en" lang="en">Name, alternate name, URL, logo, GitHub profiles, address, and expertise are exposed through structured data so AI systems can identify the company entity correctly.</p>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:277:            <h3 class="card-title"><span class="lang-ja">AIエージェントが操作しやすい導線</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Make journeys agent-readable</span></h3>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:279:              <p class="lang-ja">リンク、ボタン、フォーム、ラベル、見出し階層をセマンティックに保ち、ブラウザ型AIが問い合わせ・技術資料・会社情報を安全に辿れるようにします。</p>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:280:              <p class="lang-en" lang="en">Links, buttons, forms, labels, and heading hierarchy are kept semantic so browser agents can safely navigate company information, technical reports, and inquiry flows.</p>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:286:            <h3 class="card-title"><span class="lang-ja">公開情報だけを機械可読化する</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Expose only public signals</span></h3>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:288:              <p class="lang-ja">AIに読ませるのは公開済みの会社案内・技術カタログ・問い合わせ導線のみ。秘密情報や顧客情報は、robots.txtではなく設計上の分離で守ります。</p>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:289:              <p class="lang-en" lang="en">Only public company information, technical catalog pages, and contact routes are made machine-readable. Secrets and customer data are protected by architecture, not by robots.txt.</p>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:298:        <h2><span class="lang-ja">実装パッケージ</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Implementation package</span></h2>
