./README.md:14:Core content and navigation (`header`, `footer`) are hardcoded in static HTML rather than dynamically injected via JavaScript. This ensures that simple LLM scrapers (like `OAI-SearchBot`) and browser-based AI agents can immediately parse the full DOM tree and internal links without needing to execute JavaScript or wait for framework hydration.
./docs/ADR-0001-static-html-for-agent-readiness.md:5:通常のモダンWebフロントエンド開発では、`header.js`のようなスクリプトによるDOMの動的注入、もしくはSSG（Static Site Generator）を用いたビルドプロセスを採用し、「DRY（Don't Repeat Yourself）の原則」を守るのが定石です。
