reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:456:        <p class="lang-en" lang="en">We establish a strict separation between producer, reviewer, adopter, and release authority, ensuring that the ultimate acceptance and operational responsibility rest with a human. The diagram and table below illustrate this division of roles and the control loop.</p>
