./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:366:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Pre-defining the scope and rules for AI operations</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:372:                <span class="lang-ja">要件確定前の実装抑止</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:373:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Preventing Implementation Before Requirements</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:376:                <span class="lang-ja">ルールの事前定義なしにソースコードの変更を許さない制約</span>
./reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:377:                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Constraint forbidding code changes before rule definition</span>
