./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:237:          <span class="lang-ja">AIに見つけられ、AIに読まれ、AIに正しく紹介される企業Webへ。</span>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:238:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Make your website discoverable, readable, and accurately usable by AI.</span>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:241:          <span class="lang-ja">三嶋電算は、企業サイトを人間だけでなく、検索AI・ブラウザ型AIエージェント・アクセシビリティツリーにも読みやすい情報基盤として設計します。見た目の制作ではなく、会社情報・技術力・問い合わせ導線を機械が誤読しにくい形で公開する攻めのWeb実装です。</span>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:242:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Mishima Computing designs business websites as information infrastructure for humans, search AI, browser agents, and accessibility trees. This is not decorative web production; it is an assertive implementation layer for machine-readable company identity, technical capability, and inquiry routing.</span>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:246:            <span class="lang-ja">相談する</span>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:247:            <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Start a Consultation</span>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:250:            <span class="lang-ja">機械可読マニフェストを見る</span>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:251:            <span class="lang-en" lang="en">View Machine Manifest</span>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:259:        <h2><span class="lang-ja">攻めのWeb基盤としてのAI対応</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">AI readiness as growth infrastructure</span></h2>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:261:          <span class="lang-ja">AI検索対応は、単なるSEOやOPEX削減ではありません。潜在顧客がAIに「こういう会社を探して」と依頼した時、AIが三嶋電算を正しく候補に入れ、技術領域・実装姿勢・問い合わせ方法を明確に説明できる状態を作ることです。</span>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:262:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">AI-readiness is not merely SEO or operational cost reduction. It prepares the website so that when a potential customer asks an AI system to find a suitable engineering partner, the AI can identify Mishima Computing, summarize its technical scope, and route the user to the right action.</span>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:268:            <h3 class="card-title"><span class="lang-ja">会社エンティティを一意にする</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Define a single company entity</span></h3>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:270:              <p class="lang-ja">社名、英語名、URL、ロゴ、GitHub、所在地、対応領域を構造化データで明示し、検索AIが「誰のサイトか」を誤読しにくくします。</p>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:271:              <p class="lang-en" lang="en">Name, alternate name, URL, logo, GitHub profiles, address, and expertise are exposed through structured data so AI systems can identify the company entity correctly.</p>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:277:            <h3 class="card-title"><span class="lang-ja">AIエージェントが操作しやすい導線</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Make journeys agent-readable</span></h3>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:279:              <p class="lang-ja">リンク、ボタン、フォーム、ラベル、見出し階層をセマンティックに保ち、ブラウザ型AIが問い合わせ・技術資料・会社情報を安全に辿れるようにします。</p>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:280:              <p class="lang-en" lang="en">Links, buttons, forms, labels, and heading hierarchy are kept semantic so browser agents can safely navigate company information, technical reports, and inquiry flows.</p>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:286:            <h3 class="card-title"><span class="lang-ja">公開情報だけを機械可読化する</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Expose only public signals</span></h3>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:288:              <p class="lang-ja">AIに読ませるのは公開済みの会社案内・技術カタログ・問い合わせ導線のみ。秘密情報や顧客情報は、robots.txtではなく設計上の分離で守ります。</p>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:289:              <p class="lang-en" lang="en">Only public company information, technical catalog pages, and contact routes are made machine-readable. Secrets and customer data are protected by architecture, not by robots.txt.</p>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:298:        <h2><span class="lang-ja">実装パッケージ</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Implementation package</span></h2>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:302:              <th><span class="lang-ja">構造化データ</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Structured data</span></th>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:303:              <td><span class="lang-ja">Organization、WebSite、WebPage、Service、BreadcrumbList、FAQPageをJSON-LDで定義し、会社・サービス・ページ目的を機械可読化します。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Organization, WebSite, WebPage, Service, BreadcrumbList, and FAQPage are defined in JSON-LD to describe the company, service, and page intent.</span></td>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:306:              <th><span class="lang-ja">クロール設計</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Crawl design</span></th>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:307:              <td><span class="lang-ja">robots.txtとsitemap.xmlを整備し、公開ページを発見しやすくします。検索AIに見せるべきでない情報は公開領域に置きません。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">robots.txt and sitemap.xml are maintained so public pages are easy to discover. Non-public information is kept out of the public site entirely.</span></td>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:310:              <th><span class="lang-ja">エージェント導線</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Agent journey</span></th>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:311:              <td><span class="lang-ja">会社概要、事業領域、技術レポート、問い合わせページへのリンクを明示し、ブラウザ型AIがユーザーの目的に応じて安全に遷移できる構造にします。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Links to company overview, services, technical reports, and contact pages are explicit so browser agents can navigate safely according to user intent.</span></td>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:314:              <th><span class="lang-ja">専門コンテンツ</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Expert content</span></th>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:315:              <td><span class="lang-ja">一般論のSEO記事ではなく、実装経験・検証結果・設計判断を伴う技術カタログを増やします。AIに引用される価値のある一次情報を作ります。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Instead of commodity SEO articles, the site publishes technical catalog content with implementation context, validation results, and architectural decisions.</span></td>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:321:          <h3><span class="lang-ja">このページで公開する機械可読シグナル</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Machine-readable signals exposed by this page</span></h3>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:323:            <li><span class="lang-ja">主要URL: <code>https://mishima-computing.github.io/</code></span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Canonical URL: <code>https://mishima-computing.github.io/</code></span></li>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:324:            <li><span class="lang-ja">AI対応ページ: <code>/agent-readiness/</code></span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Agent readiness page: <code>/agent-readiness/</code></span></li>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:325:            <li><span class="lang-ja">サイトマップ: <code>/sitemap.xml</code></span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Sitemap: <code>/sitemap.xml</code></span></li>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:326:            <li><span class="lang-ja">クロール方針: <code>/robots.txt</code></span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Crawler policy: <code>/robots.txt</code></span></li>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:327:            <li><span class="lang-ja">機械可読マニフェスト: <code>/agent-readiness/manifest.json</code></span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Machine-readable manifest: <code>/agent-readiness/manifest.json</code></span></li>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:337:          <h3><span class="lang-ja">AI検索対応は従来のSEOと何が違いますか？</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">How is AI search readiness different from traditional SEO?</span></h3>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:338:          <p><span class="lang-ja">従来のSEOを土台にしつつ、検索AIが引用・要約しやすい専門コンテンツ、明確な企業エンティティ、構造化データ、クロール可能なURL構造、セマンティックHTMLを重視します。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">It builds on SEO fundamentals while emphasizing expert content, company entity clarity, structured data, crawlable URL design, and semantic HTML that search AI can interpret.</span></p>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:341:          <h3><span class="lang-ja">AIエージェント対応とは何ですか？</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">What does agent readiness mean?</span></h3>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:342:          <p><span class="lang-ja">ブラウザ型AIエージェントがDOM、アクセシビリティツリー、スクリーンショットからページの目的、導線、フォーム項目、問い合わせ先を誤読しにくいように設計することです。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">It means designing pages so browser agents can interpret purpose, navigation, form fields, and contact routes correctly from the DOM, accessibility tree, and screenshots.</span></p>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:345:          <h3><span class="lang-ja">AI検索に必ず表示されますか？</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Does this guarantee inclusion in AI search results?</span></h3>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:346:          <p><span class="lang-ja">表示や引用は検索エンジン側の判断で保証できません。三嶋電算は、公開情報をクロール可能かつ機械可読にし、正しく発見・解釈される確率を高める実装を行います。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">No. Inclusion and citations are determined by search providers. Mishima Computing implements a clearer public information structure so the site is easier to discover and interpret correctly.</span></p>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:355:          <h2 style="display: block;"><span class="lang-ja">AI時代の企業Webを、攻めの営業基盤にする。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Turn your website into AI-era sales infrastructure.</span></h2>
./mishima_agent_readiness_pack/site/agent-readiness/index.html:356:          <p><span class="lang-ja">検索AI、ブラウザ型AIエージェント、機械可読な技術カタログに対応したWeb基盤の設計・実装・検証についてご相談ください。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Consult us about designing, implementing, and validating websites prepared for search AI, browser agents, and machine-readable technical catalogs.</span></p>
