agent-readiness/index.html-446-        <ul class="signal-list" style="margin-top: 2rem; max-width: 800px;">
agent-readiness/index.html:447:          <li><span class="lang-ja">会社名でしか検索されない（サービス名で見つからない）。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Discoverable only by brand name, not service keywords.</span></li>
agent-readiness/index.html:448:          <li><span class="lang-ja">Googleマップの情報が弱く、地域検索で負けている。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Weak Google Business Profile presence losing local search.</span></li>
agent-readiness/index.html:449:          <li><span class="lang-ja">ホームページから問い合わせが来ない。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Website generates zero or very few inquiries.</span></li>
agent-readiness/index.html:450:          <li><span class="lang-ja">AIに聞いても、自社が候補に出てこない。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Generative AI doesn't include your company in its suggestions.</span></li>
agent-readiness/index.html:451:          <li><span class="lang-ja">何を頼める会社か、訪問者にパッと伝わっていない。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Unclear value proposition for immediate visitors.</span></li>
agent-readiness/index.html-452-        </ul>
