agent-readiness/index.html-823-        <h2>
agent-readiness/index.html:824:          <span class="lang-ja">よくある質問</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:825:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">FAQ</span>
agent-readiness/index.html-826-        </h2>
--
agent-readiness/index.html-828-          <h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:829:            <span class="lang-ja">AI検索対応では効果測定も行いますか？</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:830:            <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Does AI search readiness include measurement?</span>
agent-readiness/index.html-831-          </h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:832:          <p class="lang-ja">
agent-readiness/index.html-833-            はい。Cloudflare Web Analytics や問い合わせ導線の source パラメータを用いて、どのページが読まれ、どのCTAから診断依頼につながったかを確認し、構造化データ、FAQ、見出し、導線の改善に活用します。
agent-readiness/index.html-834-          </p>
agent-readiness/index.html:835:          <p class="lang-en" lang="en">
agent-readiness/index.html-836-            Yes. We use Cloudflare Web Analytics and source-tagged inquiry paths to see which pages are read and which CTAs lead to diagnostic requests, then use that evidence to refine structured data, FAQ, headings, and conversion paths.
--
agent-readiness/index.html-841-          <h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:842:            <span class="lang-ja">Cloudflare Web Analytics は商用サイトでも無料で使えますか？</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:843:            <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Can Cloudflare Web Analytics be used for commercial websites for free?</span>
agent-readiness/index.html-844-          </h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:845:          <p class="lang-ja">
agent-readiness/index.html-846-            はい。Cloudflare Web Analytics は Cloudflare の全プランで利用できる軽量なアクセス解析です。Cloudflare 経由でプロキシしていないサイトでも、JS snippet を設置することで最大10サイトまで計測できます。Cloudflare 経由でプロキシしているサイトでは、Web Analytics の対象サイト数に上限はありません。<br>
--
agent-readiness/index.html-848-          </p>
agent-readiness/index.html:849:          <p class="lang-en" lang="en">
agent-readiness/index.html-850-            Yes. Cloudflare Web Analytics is available on all Cloudflare plans. For sites not proxied through Cloudflare, up to 10 sites can be measured by installing the JavaScript snippet. For sites proxied through Cloudflare, Cloudflare lists no site limit for Web Analytics.<br>
--
agent-readiness/index.html-856-          <h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:857:            <span class="lang-ja">なぜ無料で使えるのですか？</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:858:            <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Why can it be free?</span>
agent-readiness/index.html-859-          </h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:860:          <p class="lang-ja">
agent-readiness/index.html-861-            主な理由は、Cloudflare Web Analytics が広告用の個人追跡ではなく、ページ表示や読み込み性能を把握するための軽量な計測機能として設計されているためです。Cloudflare は、Web Analytics が収集する情報を最小限のタイミング指標のみであるとし、顧客サイトをまたいで個々のエンドユーザーを追跡しないとしています。<br>
--
agent-readiness/index.html-863-          </p>
agent-readiness/index.html:864:          <p class="lang-en" lang="en">
agent-readiness/index.html-865-            The main reason is that Cloudflare Web Analytics is designed as lightweight measurement for page views and performance, not as advertising-oriented individual tracking. Cloudflare states that Web Analytics collects a minimal amount of information, mainly timing metrics, and does not track individual end users across customers’ Internet properties.<br>
--
agent-readiness/index.html-871-          <h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:872:            <span class="lang-ja">構造化データ（JSON-LD）を入れれば、AIに推薦されやすくなりますか？</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:873:            <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Will adding structured data (JSON-LD) increase AI recommendations?</span>
agent-readiness/index.html-874-          </h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:875:          <p class="lang-ja">
agent-readiness/index.html-876-            いいえ、構造化データは「AIに直接読ませる魔法の呪文」ではありません。多くのAIクローラーはレンダリング後の本文を重視します。<br>
--
agent-readiness/index.html-878-          </p>
agent-readiness/index.html:879:          <p class="lang-en" lang="en">
agent-readiness/index.html-880-            No, structured data is not a "magic spell" for AI rankings. Most AI crawlers prioritize rendered prose.<br>
--
agent-readiness/index.html-886-          <h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:887:            <span class="lang-ja">FAQPageの構造化データにはどのような効果がありますか？</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:888:            <span class="lang-en" lang="en">What is the specific effect of FAQPage structured data?</span>
agent-readiness/index.html-889-          </h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:890:          <p class="lang-ja">
agent-readiness/index.html-891-            FAQの「質問と回答」のペアは、生成AIやRAG（検索拡張生成）が情報を引き出す際の「検索単位（チャンク）」と完全に一致するため、AIがより正確に自社の情報を引用できるようになります。<br>
--
agent-readiness/index.html-893-          </p>
agent-readiness/index.html:894:          <p class="lang-en" lang="en">
agent-readiness/index.html-895-            The "Question-and-Answer" pair format in an FAQ aligns perfectly with the retrieval chunks used by Generative AI and RAG systems. This structural alignment makes it significantly easier and more accurate for AI to retrieve and cite your specific answers.<br>
--
agent-readiness/index.html-901-          <h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:902:            <span class="lang-ja">どの段階で有料プランを検討すべきですか？</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:903:            <span class="lang-en" lang="en">When should a paid Cloudflare plan be considered?</span>
agent-readiness/index.html-904-          </h3>
agent-readiness/index.html:905:          <p class="lang-ja">
agent-readiness/index.html-906-            単なる会社HP、サービス紹介ページ、問い合わせ導線の効果測定であれば、まずは無料の Cloudflare Web Analytics で十分です。一方で、EC、会員制サイト、業務停止が売上に直結するサイト、強いWAF運用、SLA、優先サポート、長期ログ保持、監査対応が必要なサイトでは、有料プランを検討します。<br>
--
agent-readiness/index.html-908-          </p>
agent-readiness/index.html:909:          <p class="lang-en" lang="en">
agent-readiness/index.html-910-            For a company website, service landing page, or inquiry-path measurement, Cloudflare Web Analytics on the free tier is usually enough to start. Paid plans should be considered for ecommerce, membership sites, revenue-critical services, stronger WAF operations, SLA, priority support, long-term log retention, or audit requirements.<br>
--
agent-readiness/index.html-920-        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
agent-readiness/index.html:921:          <span class="lang-ja">当サービスのポリシー：AIによる推薦や検索順位を「保証」する魔法ではありません</span>
agent-readiness/index.html:922:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Our Policy: We do not guarantee rankings or AI recommendations.</span>
agent-readiness/index.html-923-        </h2>
agent-readiness/index.html:924:        <p class="lang-ja" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: left; color: var(--text-secondary);">
agent-readiness/index.html-925-          本サービスは、ChatGPT、Google AI Overviews、Gemini、Claude等での表示順位や推薦を保証するものではありません。<br><br>
--
agent-readiness/index.html-927-        </p>
agent-readiness/index.html:928:        <p class="lang-en" lang="en" style="line-height: 1.8; text-align: left; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 1rem;">
agent-readiness/index.html-929-          This service does not guarantee rankings, citations, or recommendations on platforms like ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews, Gemini, or Claude. Our approach is purely technical: we systematically remove the technical roadblocks that prevent AI agents and search engines from discovering and understanding your company's information.
--
