reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:752:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">GitHub Repository</span>
reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:755:          <span class="lang-ja">技術検証のご相談</span>
reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:756:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Consult with Us</span>
reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:773:          <span class="lang-ja">AIエージェント、分散クラウドインフラ、高信頼性業務システムの設計および技術検証を行うエンジニアリング・ブティック。</span>
reports/waterfall-agents/index.html:774:          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Engineering boutique specializing in AI agents, distributed clouds, and enterprise validation.</span>
