index.html:455:              <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Autonomous Testing Methodologies in Mission-Critical Systems</span>
index.html:458:              <p class="lang-ja">設計書をもとにテスト用コード（Playwright）を自動構築・実行し、仕様変更に即追従するテストエンジンの実装結果。</p>
index.html:459:              <p class="lang-en" lang="en">Presenting empirical data on autonomous testing workflows that drastically lower QA overhead in large business platforms.</p>
