        <div>
          <span>Mishima Computing</span>
          <span class="brand-jp">三嶋電算株式会社</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <nav aria-label="Main Navigation">
        <ul class="nav-links">
          <li><a href="../#about" class="nav-link"><span class="lang-ja">会社概要</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">About</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="../#services" class="nav-link"><span class="lang-ja">事業領域</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Services</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="../#reports" class="nav-link"><span class="lang-ja">技術レポート</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Reports</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="../kessan/" class="nav-link"><span class="lang-ja">決算公告</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Public Notices</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="../contact/" class="nav-link"><span class="lang-ja">お問合せ</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Contact</span></a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <div class="nav-actions">
        <button class="lang-btn" id="lang-toggle" aria-label="Switch Language"><span>EN</span></button>
        <button class="icon-btn" id="theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle Dark/Light Mode"></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="section agent-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-pill">
          <span class="pulse"></span>
          <span>AI Search Readiness Add-on</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="hero-title">
          <span class="lang-ja">既存HPに追加できるAI検索対応アドオン</span>
          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">AI Search Readiness Add-on for Existing Sites</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-tagline">
          <span class="lang-ja">作り直し不要。今あるホームページに、検索・AI・問い合わせ導線の補強を追加します。会社情報、サービス内容、FAQ、構造化データを整備し、Google検索・マップ・生成AI検索に伝わりやすい営業基盤へ整えます。</span>
          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">No full rebuild required. We add crucial search, AI, and inquiry structures to your existing website, ensuring your business is discoverable and readable by Google Search, Maps, and AI agents.</span>
        </p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a href="../contact/?subject=free_diagnostic&amp;src=agent_readiness_hero" class="btn btn-primary">
            <span class="lang-ja">無料でAI検索・HP診断を依頼する</span>
            <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Request Free AI Diagnostics</span>
          </a>
          <a href="#plans" class="btn btn-secondary">
            <span class="lang-ja">プランを見る</span>
            <span class="lang-en" lang="en">View Plans</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-strip">
          <a href="manifest.json">manifest.json</a>
          <a href="../llms.txt">llms.txt</a>
          <a href="../sitemap.xml">sitemap.xml</a>
          <a href="../robots.txt">robots.txt</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 1: 課題提起 -->
    <section class="section" id="pain-points" style="background-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.01);">
      <div class="container">
        <h2><span class="lang-ja">こんな課題はありませんか？</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Common Challenges</span></h2>
        <p class="agent-section-note">
          <span class="lang-ja">デザインを綺麗にしても、情報設計や検索・AI向けの構造が弱ければ見込み客には届きません。</span>
          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Beautiful design alone cannot generate leads if the underlying information architecture is weak.</span>
        </p>

        <ul class="signal-list" style="margin-top: 2rem; max-width: 800px;">
          <li><span class="lang-ja">会社名でしか検索されない（サービス名で見つからない）。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Discoverable only by brand name, not service keywords.</span></li>
          <li><span class="lang-ja">Googleマップの情報が弱く、地域検索で負けている。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Weak Google Business Profile presence losing local search.</span></li>
          <li><span class="lang-ja">ホームページから問い合わせが来ない。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Website generates zero or very few inquiries.</span></li>
          <li><span class="lang-ja">AIに聞いても、自社が候補に出てこない。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Generative AI doesn't include your company in its suggestions.</span></li>
          <li><span class="lang-ja">何を頼める会社か、訪問者にパッと伝わっていない。</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">Unclear value proposition for immediate visitors.</span></li>
        </ul>

        <!-- CONCEPT ILLUSTRATION -->
        <div style="text-align: center; margin: 3rem 0 1rem 0;">
          <img src="../assets/images/ai_concept_art.jpg" alt="情報が整理されたHPと、情報が混沌としたHPにおけるAIエージェントの挙動の違い" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); max-height: 400px; object-fit: contain;">
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 1rem;">
            <span class="lang-ja">左：情報構造が整理され、AIがスムーズにデータを連携できるHP<br>右：構造化されておらず、AIが情報を探せず迷子になるHP</span>
            <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Left: Structured architecture where AI seamlessly connects data.<br>Right: Unstructured pages where AI struggles to extract information.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 1.5: AIが情報を拾う4つの経路 -->
    <section class="section" id="ai-pathways">
      <div class="container">
        <h2><span class="lang-ja">AIが会社情報を取得する4つの経路</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">4 Pathways of AI Information Retrieval</span></h2>
        <p class="agent-section-note">
          <span class="lang-ja">「AI検索対応」は流行語でも魔法でもありません。AIがウェブから情報を拾い上げる実際の経路（パス）は複数存在します。本アドオンでは、それぞれの経路における技術的な障害を取り除きます。</span>
          <span class="lang-en" lang="en">"AI Search Readiness" is not magic. AI systems gather information through multiple distinct technical pathways. Our add-on clears technical roadblocks across all of them.</span>
        </p>

        <!-- HTML/CSS FLOWCHART -->
        <div class="ai-flowchart">
          <div class="flow-node">
            <div class="flow-pill">
              <span class="lang-ja" style="line-height: 1.6;">見込み客の質問<br><strong style="color:var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.1rem;">「高い技術力でレガシーシステムの刷新を任せられる会社は？」</strong></span>
              <span class="lang-en" lang="en" style="line-height: 1.6;">Prospect's Query<br><strong style="color:var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.1rem;">"Highly technical companies for legacy system modernization?"</strong></span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="flow-arrow-down">▼</div>
          
          <div class="flow-node">
            <div class="flow-pill highlight">
              <span class="lang-ja">生成AI・検索AIが情報を探す</span>
              <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Generative AI / Search AI looks for information</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="flow-arrow-down">▼</div>

          <div class="flow-tree">
            <div class="flow-tree-item">
              <div class="flow-path-img" style="background-position: 0% 0%;"></div>
              <div class="flow-tree-text">
                <div class="flow-tree-title"><span class="lang-ja">1. 検索エンジンのインデックス</span><span class="lang-en" lang="en">1. Search Engine Index</span></div>
