          </span>
          <span class="lang-en" lang="en" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
            AI search readiness does not end with structured data.<br>
            We need to observe which pages are read, which paths lead to inquiries, and continuously refine company information, service descriptions, FAQ, and CTAs.<br>
            Mishima Computing designs lightweight measurement infrastructure focused on improving information architecture and inquiry paths, not identifying individual visitors. (<a href="https://github.com/mishima-computing/mishima-computing.github.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500;"><svg width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: -0.125em; margin-right: 0.2em;"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.477 2 12c0 4.42 2.865 8.166 6.839 9.489.5.092.682-.217.682-.482 0-.237-.008-.866-.013-1.7-2.782.603-3.369-1.34-3.369-1.34-.454-1.156-1.11-1.464-1.11-1.464-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.03 1.531 1.03.892 1.529 2.341 1.087 2.91.831.092-.646.35-1.086.636-1.336-2.22-.253-4.555-1.11-4.555-4.943 0-1.091.39-1.984 1.029-2.683-.103-.253-.446-1.27.098-2.647 0 0 .84-.269 2.75 1.025A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.294 2.747-1.025 2.747-1.025.546 1.377.203 2.394.1 2.647.64.699 1.028 1.592 1.028 2.683 0 3.842-2.339 4.687-4.566 4.935.359.309.678.919.678 1.852 0 1.336-.012 2.415-.012 2.743 0 .267.18.579.688.481C19.137 20.162 22 16.418 22 12c0-5.523-4.477-10-10-10z"/></svg>This very website serves as a live implementation showcase of this setup.</a>)
